/research/style-aggregation/runs/quality-p7-*/**/draft-diff.md whitespace=-blank-at-eol
# P8 frozen source snapshots keep binary PDF xref bytes and generated diff markers intact.
/research/style-aggregation/runs/product-acceptance-local-01/**/blobs/* -text -diff
/research/style-aggregation/runs/product-acceptance-local-01/**/draft-diff.md whitespace=-blank-at-eol
